sequenceDiagram
    participant Can as Canary host
    participant J as Journal (replicated)
    participant H as Non-canary host
    Can->>J: applied(item X, digest D) at t0
    Note over J: wait >= 41h, no later held/reverted
    Can->>J: any record or alive heartbeat after t0+wait
    H->>J: gate check for X@D
    alt evidence + liveness present
        H->>H: apply X
    else canary silent or reverted
        H->>H: hold X (silence is never a pass)
    end
